{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1749860/extras/61d4b201e189cfac7df09ad0d55b8619.poster.avif?t=1770348600\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1749860/extras/61d4b201e189cfac7df09ad0d55b8619.webm?t=1770348600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience detailed, true-to-life recreations of beautiful and diverse locations around the world. Trek through and explore environments to capture stunning vistas and landscapes with your fully-featured in-game camera. Each environment is filled with objectives to reward players that have a good eye for angles and perspectives, and hidden secrets for those who are patient and observant. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rich atmosphere of Lushfoil Photography Sim is enhanced by an ambient, ethereal soundtrack featuring licensed music from artists around the world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1749860/extras/51ec3d5b2da7941493ec3697efe8c534.poster.avif?t=1770348600\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1749860/extras/51ec3d5b2da7941493ec3697efe8c534.webm?t=1770348600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1749860/extras/51ec3d5b2da7941493ec3697efe8c534.mp4?t=1770348600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Capture the Perfect Shot</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The in-game camera includes an abundance of settings that you'd expect from a real-world professional DSLR camera. The camera simulates settings such as Auto/Manual Focus, Flash, Exposure, Contrast, White Balance, Aperture, Burst Shot and other effects for full creative control over your photography. The game further provides tools that allow for manipulation of  the environmental conditions for your photos, such as manual adjustment of light angles, fog, snow, wind, and rain.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1749860/extras/c6cf44e441ae8f9f43e2b8ba07076754.poster.avif?t=1770348600\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1749860/extras/c6cf44e441ae8f9f43e2b8ba07076754.webm?t=1770348600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1749860/extras/c6cf44e441ae8f9f43e2b8ba07076754.mp4?t=1770348600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Off the Beaten Path</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive deeper into the game\u2019s many locations to find unlockable cameras and experience the world from unique perspectives. Find a first-person drone that allows you to soar above the landscape and capture the world from above, or find a hidden rowboat that allows you to traverse still waters in pursuit of the perfect shot. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1749860/extras/0167e140811880bbf1c9fed255b47755.poster.avif?t=1770348600\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1749860/extras/0167e140811880bbf1c9fed255b47755.webm?t=1770348600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1749860/extras/0167e140811880bbf1c9fed255b47755.mp4?t=1770348600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Very Efficiently Optimised</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each environment has been created in Unreal Engine 5 and is built from the ground up to be both efficiently optimized and showcase the game\u2019s locations in stunning visual fidelity. There are extensive custom settings that will help the game run on a wide range of PCs, while taking full advantage of high-end graphics cards. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"?????","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1749860/d8e635dacc5d7e414eec8fefa4b4c6d300753b08.jpg"},{"name":"credits","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1749860/ff219f2f680449e357e2567c82cf912420a352b5.jpg"},{"name":"100%","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1749860/601c6edb2ea6c93dc3b9c36bf1605c674ed3e908.jpg"},{"name":"complete!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1749860/1a93d52ff2f5fa4f496fcbaf6b5338fa001d6099.jpg"},{"name":"VideoGames","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1749860/e973d98bc8950be41057646dcfada2b34fb65eee.jpg"},{"name":"not an enthusiast","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1749860/fa1f5e125ad1451ea2e9755c2d1af6386713f393.jpg"},{"name":"enthusiast","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1749860/7375e1ff0ddde97225965d12671490542895b778.jpg"},{"name":"Lago di Braies Complete","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1749860/ac82f48335319fc68a2794e01454487b00338f42.jpg"},{"name":"Castle Rock Beach Complete","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1749860/ca032aa77219ef4746d4604ae35e00d1c8432a7f.jpg"},{"name":"Fushimi Inari Taisha Complete","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1749860/41f3e0a614a08ce8224dba3237e0baba4b1d4157.jpg"}],"total":22},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1749860?t=1770348600","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1749860/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770348600","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1749860/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770348600","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1749860/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770348600","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"VR Supported","id":53},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1749860/extras/61d4b201e189cfac7df09ad0d55b8619.poster.avif?t=1770348600\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1749860/extras/61d4b201e189cfac7df09ad0d55b8619.webm?t=1770348600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience detailed, true-to-life recreations of beautiful and diverse locations around the world. Trek through and explore environments to capture stunning vistas and landscapes with your fully-featured in-game camera. Each environment is filled with objectives to reward players that have a good eye for angles and perspectives, and hidden secrets for those who are patient and observant. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rich atmosphere of Lushfoil Photography Sim is enhanced by an ambient, ethereal soundtrack featuring licensed music from artists around the world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1749860/extras/51ec3d5b2da7941493ec3697efe8c534.poster.avif?t=1770348600\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1749860/extras/51ec3d5b2da7941493ec3697efe8c534.webm?t=1770348600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1749860/extras/51ec3d5b2da7941493ec3697efe8c534.mp4?t=1770348600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Capture the Perfect Shot</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The in-game camera includes an abundance of settings that you'd expect from a real-world professional DSLR camera. The camera simulates settings such as Auto/Manual Focus, Flash, Exposure, Contrast, White Balance, Aperture, Burst Shot and other effects for full creative control over your photography. The game further provides tools that allow for manipulation of  the environmental conditions for your photos, such as manual adjustment of light angles, fog, snow, wind, and rain.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1749860/extras/c6cf44e441ae8f9f43e2b8ba07076754.poster.avif?t=1770348600\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1749860/extras/c6cf44e441ae8f9f43e2b8ba07076754.webm?t=1770348600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1749860/extras/c6cf44e441ae8f9f43e2b8ba07076754.mp4?t=1770348600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Off the Beaten Path</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive deeper into the game\u2019s many locations to find unlockable cameras and experience the world from unique perspectives. Find a first-person drone that allows you to soar above the landscape and capture the world from above, or find a hidden rowboat that allows you to traverse still waters in pursuit of the perfect shot. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1749860/extras/0167e140811880bbf1c9fed255b47755.poster.avif?t=1770348600\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1749860/extras/0167e140811880bbf1c9fed255b47755.webm?t=1770348600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1749860/extras/0167e140811880bbf1c9fed255b47755.mp4?t=1770348600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Very Efficiently Optimised</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each environment has been created in Unreal Engine 5 and is built from the ground up to be both efficiently optimized and showcase the game\u2019s locations in stunning visual fidelity. There are extensive custom settings that will help the game run on a wide range of PCs, while taking full advantage of high-end graphics cards. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Matt Newell"],"dlc":[3887900],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com